"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.id != object.commercial_partner_id.id\">Dear <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> (<t t-out=\"object.commercial_partner_id.name or ''\"/>),</t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">Dear <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/>,</t>\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        We are disappointed to see that despite sending a reminder, that your account is now seriously overdue.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        It is essential that immediate payment is made, otherwise we will have to consider placing a stop on your account which means that we will no longer be able to supply your company with (goods/services). Please, take appropriate measures in order to carry out this payment in the next 8 days.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        If there is a problem with paying invoice that we are not aware of, do not hesitate to contact our accounting department, so that we can resolve the matter quickly.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Details of due payments is printed below.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Best Regards,\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"not is_html_empty(object._get_followup_responsible().signature)\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_followup_responsible().signature\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            --\n"
"                            <br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_followup_responsible().name\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"    <p>\n"
"        <t t-if=\"object.id != object.commercial_partner_id.id\">\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> (<t t-out=\"object.commercial_partner_id.name or ''\"/>) گرامی،\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> گرامی،\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        متأسفیم که علی‌رغم ارسال یادآوری، حساب شما همچنان به‌صورت جدی معوق مانده است.\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        ضروری است که فوراً پرداخت انجام شود؛ در غیر این صورت ممکن است مجبور شویم حساب شما را مسدود کنیم، که به معنای عدم امکان ارائه (کالا/خدمات) به شرکت شما خواهد بود. لطفاً اقدامات لازم را برای انجام این پرداخت در ۸ روز آینده انجام دهید.\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        در صورتی که مشکلی در پرداخت این فاکتور وجود دارد که ما از آن بی‌اطلاع هستیم، لطفاً با واحد حسابداری تماس بگیرید تا بتوانیم موضوع را در کوتاه‌ترین زمان ممکن برطرف کنیم.\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        جزئیات پرداخت‌های سررسید شده در ادامه درج شده است.\n"
"        <br/>\n"
"        با احترام،\n"
"        <t t-if=\"not is_html_empty(object._get_followup_responsible().signature)\">\n"
"            <br/>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object._get_followup_responsible().signature\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"            <br/>\n"
"            --\n"
"            <br/>\n"
"            <t t-out=\"object._get_followup_responsible().name\"/>\n"
"        </t>\n"
"    </p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"            "

#: model:mail.template,body_html:account_followup.email_template_followup_1
#. module: account_followup
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.id != object.commercial_partner_id.id\">Dear <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> (<t t-out=\"object.commercial_partner_id.name or ''\"/>),</t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">Dear <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/>,</t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        We would like to inform you that your account shows an outstanding balance of <b><t t-out=\"format_amount(object.total_overdue_followup, object.currency_id) or ''\"/></b>.\n"
"                        We kindly ask that you settle this amount within the next <b>8 days</b>.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p t-if=\"object._show_pay_now_button()\">\n"
"                        <a t-att-href=\"'/my/invoices/overdue'\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 12px; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none !important; font-weight: 400; background-color: #875A7B; border: 0px solid #875A7B; border-radius:3px\">Pay now</a>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        If payment has already been made, please disregard this notice.\n"
"                        For any questions or if you need assistance, feel free to contact our accounting department.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        We appreciate your cooperation in resolving this matter.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        Sincerely,\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"not is_html_empty(object._get_followup_responsible().signature)\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_followup_responsible().signature\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_followup_responsible().name\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"object.id != object.commercial_partner_id.id\"><t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> (<t t-out=\"object.commercial_partner_id.name or ''\"/>) گرامی،</t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\"><t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/> گرامی،</t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        بدین‌وسیله به اطلاع می‌رسانیم که حساب شما دارای مانده معوق <b><t t-out=\"format_amount(object.total_overdue_followup, object.currency_id) or ''\"/></b> است.\n"
"                        خواهشمندیم این مبلغ را ظرف <b>۸ روز</b> آینده تسویه نمایید.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p t-if=\"object._show_pay_now_button()\">\n"
"                        <a t-att-href=\"'/my/invoices/overdue'\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 12px; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none !important; font-weight: 400; background-color: #875A7B; border: 0px solid #875A7B; border-radius:3px\">پرداخت</a>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        اگر پرداخت را انجام داده‌اید، لطفاً این پیام را نادیده بگیرید.\n"
"                        در صورت داشتن هرگونه سؤال یا نیاز به راهنمایی، لطفاً با واحد حسابداری ما تماس بگیرید.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        از همکاری شما در این زمینه سپاسگزاریم.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        با احترام،\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        <t t-if=\"not is_html_empty(object._get_followup_responsible().signature)\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_followup_responsible().signature\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                        <t t-else=\"\">\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object._get_followup_responsible().name\"/>\n"
"                        </t>\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"            "

