#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_payment_sadad
#. module: base
msgid ""
"Professional Sadad Shaparak Payment Gateway Integration for Odoo\n"
"\n"
"This module provides seamless integration with Sadad payment gateway, enabling secure online payments through the Shaparak network for Iranian businesses.\n"
"\n"
"**Key Features:**\n"
"• Secure 3DES encryption for transaction data protection\n"
"• Real-time payment verification and status updates\n"
"• Native Iranian Rial (IRR) currency support\n"
"• Configurable minimum transaction amounts\n"
"• Comprehensive error handling and logging\n"
"• Mobile-responsive payment interface\n"
"• Test and production environment support\n"
"\n"
"**Technical Specifications:**\n"
"• API Integration: Sadad Shaparak REST API v0\n"
"• Encryption: Triple DES in ECB mode with Base64 encoding\n"
"• Security: Token-based verification with CSRF protection\n"
"• Performance: 30-second timeout with efficient database queries\n"
"• Compatibility: Full Odoo 18 integration\n"
"\n"
"**Business Benefits:**\n"
"• Streamlined payment processing for Iranian market\n"
"• Enhanced customer experience with secure checkout\n"
"• Reduced payment failures with robust error handling\n"
"• Improved cash flow with real-time transaction updates\n"
"• Professional payment interface matching your brand\n"
"\n"
"**Use Cases:**\n"
"• E-commerce websites requiring Iranian payment processing\n"
"• Service businesses accepting online payments\n"
"• Subscription-based services with recurring billing\n"
"• B2B platforms requiring secure payment gateways\n"
"• Any Odoo installation serving Iranian customers\n"
"\n"
"**Support Information:**\n"
"• 24/7 technical support via odoopishro@gmail.com\n"
"• Comprehensive documentation and setup guides\n"
"• Live demo available at demo.odoopishro.com\n"
"• Professional implementation services available\n"
"• Regular updates and security patches included\n"
"\n"
"Developed by OdooPishro - The pioneer Odoo implementation partner.\n"
msgstr ""

